        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The strictest rule wins, in the order Deny > Ask > Allow, however specific a rule is. Ask and Deny still apply in bypass permissions mode. Changes apply to all projects and to conversations started afterwards."
