        }
      }
    },
    "写成 工具名 或 工具名(参数)。比如 Bash(npm run test:*)、Read(./.env)、Edit(src/**)、WebFetch(domain:github.com)、mcp__github（整个服务器）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write Tool or Tool(arguments), such as Bash(npm run test:*), Read(./.env), Edit(src/**), WebFetch(domain:github.com) or mcp__github (the whole server)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "编辑规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit rule"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "规则不能是空的": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rule can't be empty"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整个服务器": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whole server"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整个服务器的设置管它的每个工具；工具自己也设了的，取更严的那个。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The whole-server setting covers each of its tools; where a tool has its own setting too, the stricter one wins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要按工具设置，在上一页的“规则”里手写 %@__工具名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To set individual tools, write %@__toolname under “Rules” on the previous page."
          }
        }
      }
